# Context

## Background
Improves the terminal presentation and keeps provider credentials unavailable to generated shell commands. The README demo is now visible near the product introduction.

## Why This Way
Validation normalizes shell builtin and shell-path requirements before enforcing the external executable requirement. The first-use notice and Markdown renderer use shared display-width-aware layout helpers.

## Gotchas
The context note is pushed separately because Git notes are not included in an ordinary branch push.
